  <name>Philippines 50-Site 5G NR n50 (1.5 GHz) FWA Network Plan &amp; Unserved Barangays</name>
  <description>Strictly 50 Proposed 5G NR n50 (1.5 GHz, 6.0 km radius) Base Station Sites covering 473 Unserved/Underserved Barangays, 836,264 citizens, and 175,820 Estimated Households. Upfront Core CAPEX removed (replaced by PHP 10.00/sub/mo Core Supplier fee); SUF: PHP 5.00/sub/mo in lieu of established SUF.</description>
